{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Vivid World",
    "steam_appid": 2468550,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vivid World is a completely new party-building roguelike auto-battler, where you assemble a team of characters that have transformed into jewels to engage in combat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transverse a new world with quirky characters who've all been redesigned from Vivid Knight! Create your own unique and powerful party to clear every dungeon in your way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More in-depth party building than before!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468550/extras/12407c6bda0133dd2c654f69bbaad3ca.poster.avif?t=1748328384\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468550/extras/12407c6bda0133dd2c654f69bbaad3ca.webm?t=1748328384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468550/extras/12407c6bda0133dd2c654f69bbaad3ca.mp4?t=1748328384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you know the proverb: &quot;Three heads are better than one&quot;?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather several of the same jewels, enhance them, and see your buffs and synergy explode with power!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And now, introducing &quot;Orbs.&quot; You can equip Orbs to each character in your party, which means your ability to create and change your party has now expanded infinitely!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strategic battles.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468550/extras/1c26f737925784851ccdc620f20df76e.poster.avif?t=1748328384\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468550/extras/1c26f737925784851ccdc620f20df76e.webm?t=1748328384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468550/extras/1c26f737925784851ccdc620f20df76e.mp4?t=1748328384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, the battles advance automatically while the player utilizes &quot;Gems&quot; to support their party during battle phases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With our new and improved battle system, the player can combine several Gems together or unleash the power of individual Gems!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy strategic battles with greater freedom than ever before!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Resource management that will test your thinking.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468550/extras/b0c4bf6407a04e36c690f24c5d58748c.poster.avif?t=1748328384\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468550/extras/b0c4bf6407a04e36c690f24c5d58748c.webm?t=1748328384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468550/extras/b0c4bf6407a04e36c690f24c5d58748c.mp4?t=1748328384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The characters who battle for you are, after all, only jewels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That means you can &quot;buy and sell&quot; them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can buy different types of Jewels or strengthen a single Jewel by merging several of the same Jewel with it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choice is yours. Feel free to play around with your resources however you see fit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're too greedy, you might find yourself being sucked into a dungeon here in the Underworld that you can't get out of.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A world shrouded in mystery.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Underworld's deep, dark secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those secrets will be revealed as you conquer dungeons and interact with the denizens of the Underworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just who are these characters who have transformed into Jewels?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By strengthening your bonds with them and unleashing their hidden powers, you might find that out as well.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vivid World is a completely new party-building roguelike auto-battler, where you assemble a team of characters that have transformed into jewels to engage in combat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transverse a new world with quirky characters who've all been redesigned from Vivid Knight! Create your own unique and powerful party to clear every dungeon in your way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More in-depth party building than before!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468550/extras/12407c6bda0133dd2c654f69bbaad3ca.poster.avif?t=1748328384\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468550/extras/12407c6bda0133dd2c654f69bbaad3ca.webm?t=1748328384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468550/extras/12407c6bda0133dd2c654f69bbaad3ca.mp4?t=1748328384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you know the proverb: &quot;Three heads are better than one&quot;?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather several of the same jewels, enhance them, and see your buffs and synergy explode with power!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And now, introducing &quot;Orbs.&quot; You can equip Orbs to each character in your party, which means your ability to create and change your party has now expanded infinitely!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strategic battles.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468550/extras/1c26f737925784851ccdc620f20df76e.poster.avif?t=1748328384\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468550/extras/1c26f737925784851ccdc620f20df76e.webm?t=1748328384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468550/extras/1c26f737925784851ccdc620f20df76e.mp4?t=1748328384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, the battles advance automatically while the player utilizes &quot;Gems&quot; to support their party during battle phases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With our new and improved battle system, the player can combine several Gems together or unleash the power of individual Gems!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy strategic battles with greater freedom than ever before!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Resource management that will test your thinking.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468550/extras/b0c4bf6407a04e36c690f24c5d58748c.poster.avif?t=1748328384\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468550/extras/b0c4bf6407a04e36c690f24c5d58748c.webm?t=1748328384\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2468550/extras/b0c4bf6407a04e36c690f24c5d58748c.mp4?t=1748328384\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The characters who battle for you are, after all, only jewels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That means you can &quot;buy and sell&quot; them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can buy different types of Jewels or strengthen a single Jewel by merging several of the same Jewel with it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choice is yours. Feel free to play around with your resources however you see fit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're too greedy, you might find yourself being sucked into a dungeon here in the Underworld that you can't get out of.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A world shrouded in mystery.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Underworld's deep, dark secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those secrets will be revealed as you conquer dungeons and interact with the denizens of the Underworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just who are these characters who have transformed into Jewels?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By strengthening your bonds with them and unleashing their hidden powers, you might find that out as well.</p>",
    "short_description": "A follow-up to the hit game Vivid Knight, Vivid World is a completely new party-building, roguelike strategy game! Our story takes place in the Underworld, a land ruled by demons. Utilize and master our protagonist, Lemuria's new Jewel Magic to conquer strange dungeons.",
